"item\":\"https://revonix.co\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Terms of use\",\"item\":\"https://revonix.co/terms\"}]}]}</script><article class=\"site-article\"><header class=\"site-hero\"><div class=\"site-wrap\"><div class=\"site-meta\"><span>Legal</span></div><h1 class=\"site-title\">Terms of use</h1><p class=\"site-lede\">The rules for using the Revonix website. Client projects are covered by your own signed proposal and contract, not by these terms.</p></div></header><div class=\"site-wrap site-section\"><div class=\"site-article-grid mt-0\"><aside aria-label=\"Table of contents\" class=\"site-toc\"><h2 class=\"site-label\">On this page</h2><ol id=\"toc\"><li><a href=\"#client-work-is-covered-by-your-contract\">Client work is covered by your contract</a></li><li><a href=\"#using-the-website\">Using the website</a></li><li><a href=\"#our-content\">Our content</a></li><li><a href=\"#what-you-send-us\">What you send us</a></li><li><a href=\"#free-consultations-and-audits\">Free consultations and audits</a></li><li><a href=\"#links-to-other-websites\">Links to other websites</a></li><li><a href=\"#no-warranty\">No warranty</a></li><li><a href=\"#limitation-of-liability\">Limitation of liability</a></li><li><a href=\"#governing-law\">Governing law</a></li><li><a href=\"#changes\">Changes</a></li><li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li></ol></aside><div class=\"site-article-body\"><div class=\"site-prose\"><p><b>Effective date: 9 November 2026</b></p>\r\n<p>These terms apply to your use of revonix.co (the \"website\"), run by Revonix Innovation LLC (\"Revonix\", \"we\", \"us\"), a company registered in Wyoming, USA, at 30 N Gould St, Ste R, Sheridan, WY 82801. By using the website, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use the website.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"client-work-is-covered-by-your-contract\">Client work is covered by your contract</h2>\r\n<p>These terms cover the website only. Any work we do for you (scope, price, timeline, payment, ownership of what we build, confidentiality and support) is governed by the written proposal and contract you sign with us. If those documents and these terms differ, your signed contract wins.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"using-the-website\">Using the website</h2>\r\n<p>You may browse the website, read our content and contact us for your own business purposes. You agree not to:</p>\r\n<ul><li>use the website in a way that breaks the law or anyone's rights;</li><li>send spam, false information or someone else's personal data without their permission through our forms;</li><li>try to break, overload or get unauthorised access to the website, our admin tools or our systems;</li><li>copy large parts of the website, or scrape it, to build a competing service.</li></ul>\r\n<p>We may limit or block access if we believe someone is misusing the website.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"our-content\">Our content</h2>\r\n<p>The website's text, design, graphics, illustrations and code belong to Revonix or the people who licensed them to us. Client names, logos and reviews belong to their owners. Product names and logos of the tools we build with belong to their owners; showing them doesn't mean those companies endorse us.</p>\r\n<p>You may share links to our pages and quote short parts with a credit to Revonix. Anything else needs our written permission.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"what-you-send-us\">What you send us</h2>\r\n<p>When you send us information through a form, email or call, you confirm it is accurate and that you are allowed to share it. We use it as described in our <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a>. Please don't send confidential information before we have agreed in writing how it will be protected.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"free-consultations-and-audits\">Free consultations and audits</h2>\r\n<p>Free consultations, audits and estimates are offered in good faith to help you decide. They are not professional, legal or financial advice, and they don't commit either of us to anything until a proposal and contract are signed.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"links-to-other-websites\">Links to other websites</h2>\r\n<p>The website links to other sites and tools, such as Cal.com, Upwork, Fiverr and LinkedIn. We are not responsible for their content or how they handle your data.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"no-warranty\">No warranty</h2>\r\n<p>The website and everything on it is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\". We work to keep it accurate and online, but we don't promise it will always be available, error-free or up to date. Examples, figures and case studies describe past work and are not a promise of the same results for you.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"limitation-of-liability\">Limitation of liability</h2>\r\n<p>To the fullest extent the law allows, Revonix is not liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential loss, or for loss of profit, revenue or data, that comes from using or not being able to use the website. Our total liability for any claim about the website is limited to USD 100. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"governing-law\">Governing law</h2>\r\n<p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Wyoming, USA, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute about the website will be dealt with by the state or federal courts located in Wyoming, unless the law where you live gives you the right to bring it elsewhere.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"changes\">Changes</h2>\r\n<p>We may update these terms. The effective date at the top shows when they last changed. Using the website after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"contact\">Contact</h2>\r\n<p>Questions about these terms: email <b>hello@revonix.co</b> or call +1 (832) 323-7219.</p></div></div></div></div></article>"
